    "long_instructions": "Both the **Skip 10s** and **Rewind 10s** buttons currently use functions without names — written directly inside addEventListener. You'll work with AI Tutor to refactor the Skip button into a named arrow function, then write the Rewind function yourself.\r\n\r\n### For the Skip 10s button — with AI:\r\n\r\n1. Highlight the event handler for the Skip 10s button and select \"Add to AI Tutor Chat.\"\r\n\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to rewrite it as a named arrow function.\r\n\r\n3. Find each part of the AI's function — the name, the arrow, and the body. Did it match your prediction?\r\n\r\n4. Click **Skip 10s**. Does the image brighten and the progress bar advance?\r\n\r\n::: details [**🔎 Show me how**]\r\n \r\n *Drag out instruction panel to enlarge image.*\r\n![](https://images.code.org/9135962f0bc281a66d10eb99984d7f6f-image-1782397687814.png)\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n### For the Rewind 10s button — on your own:\r\n\r\n5. Now write a named arrow function called `rewind` that handles the Rewind button.\r\n   - Use the AI-generated function as a model.\r\n   - AI Tutor won't write this one for you, but it can help if you have questions about the syntax.\r\n\r\n6. Connect your `rewind` function to the Rewind button using `addEventListener`.\r\n\r\n7. Click **Rewind 10s**. Does the image darken and the progress bar move back?\r\n\r\n   \r\n::: details [**🔎 Show me how**]\r\n \r\n *Drag out instruction panel to enlarge image.*\r\n![](https://images.code.org/c7ee5d9b975ba3c17162cd0e5582bd77-image-1782397721554.png)\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Stories</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"story-container\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bars\">\n      <div class=\"progress-segment watched\"></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-segment watched\"></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-segment active\">\n        <div id=\"progressBar\" class=\"progress-segment-fill\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"progress-segment\"></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-segment\"></div>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"story-header\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">🌅</div>\n      <div class=\"header-text\">\n        <span class=\"username\">sunset_daily</span>\n        <span class=\"timestamp\">2h</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n    <img class=\"story-image\" src=\"story.png\" alt=\"A scenic mountain sunset\">\n  \n    <div id=\"darkOverlay\" class=\"dark-overlay\"></div>\n  \n    <div class=\"story-gradient\"></div>\n  \n    <div class=\"story-footer\">\n      <div class=\"reply-input\">Send message</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button id=\"rewindButton\" class=\"control-button\">⏪ Rewind 10s</button>\n    <button id=\"forwardButton\" class=\"control-button\">Skip 10s ⏩</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "const forwardButton = document.getElementById(\"forwardButton\");\nconst rewindButton = document.getElementById(\"rewindButton\");\nconst progressBar = document.getElementById(\"progressBar\");\nconst darkOverlay = document.getElementById(\"darkOverlay\");\nlet progress = 30;\n\nforwardButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  progress = progress + 10;\n  progressBar.style.width = progress + \"%\";\n  darkOverlay.style.opacity = (100 - progress) / 100;\n});\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "story.png",
          "contents": "",
          "folderId": "0",
          "url": "/level_starter_assets/pl-sandbox-aif2-u2-functions-practice-lab-18_2026/uuid/96aa5f5e-a50f-466e-9025-62a2a4a44d59.png",
          "type": "starter",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  background: #1d1d1f;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 24px;\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n.story-container {\n  width: 360px;\n  height: 640px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  background: #000;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n}\n\n.dark-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  background: black;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n  z-index: 2;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.progress-bars {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 12px;\n  left: 12px;\n  right: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 3px;\n  z-index: 3;\n}\n\n.progress-segment {\n  flex: 1;\n  height: 2.5px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.progress-segment.watched {\n  background: white;\n}\n\n.progress-segment.active {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n}\n\n.progress-segment-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  width: 10%;\n  background: white;\n  transition: width 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.story-header {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 28px;\n  left: 12px;\n  z-index: 3;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.avatar {\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b9d, #ffd89b);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: 2px solid white;\n}\n\n.header-text {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.username {\n  color: white;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n}\n\n.timestamp {\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n}\n\n.story-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.story-gradient {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 140px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.5), transparent);\n  z-index: 1;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.story-footer {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.6), transparent);\n  z-index: 3;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.reply-input {\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\n.control-button {\n  background: white;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 14px 24px;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #1d1d1f;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n}\n\n.control-button:hover {\n  background: #f5f5f7;\n}",
